course: dictionary
lesson: 7103
title: Peanut: more than a snack
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A peanut is a small oval seed that grows in a shell under the ground. People roast it or salt it and eat it as a snack, or make it into peanut butter and sauces.
explain: Words can have more than one meaning. «He works for peanuts» does not mean he works with nuts. Peanuts can also mean a very small amount of money. Check the words around the word to find out which meaning fits.
explain: Some people have a serious peanut allergy. For them, even a small amount can cause a dangerous reaction, so many schools are «nut-free». Here the word matters for safety, not just for snacks.
fact: A peanut grows in a shell under the ground.
fact: Peanuts can be eaten roasted or salted, or made into peanut butter.
fact: «For peanuts» means for a very small amount of money.
fact: A peanut allergy is a serious allergy, so many schools are nut-free.
fact: In science, a peanut is really a legume, like peas and beans, not a true nut.
exercise: «He works for peanuts.» What does "for peanuts" mean here? | *For a very small amount of money | Working very fast | Working with a monkey | Working in a shop that sells nuts
exercise: «Mice will eat cheese, but they prefer grains, seeds and sweet foods, so people baiting traps usually use peanut butter.» What does prefer mean? | Throw away | *Like better | Hide from | Hate most
exercise: «Many children grow out of milk and egg allergies; peanut and tree nut allergies more often last.» Which allergies more often last? | None of them | Milk and egg allergies | *Peanut and tree nut allergies | Both are the same
test: Why are many schools nut-free? | Because peanuts are not allowed to grow | Because nuts are too expensive | Because nuts are too heavy to carry | *Because some people have a serious peanut allergy
test: In science, what kind of plant family is the peanut really in? | A tree nut family | A berry family | A grass family | *The legume family, like peas and beans
exam: Which phrase uses peanuts to mean a very small amount of money? | Salted peanuts | Peanut allergy | *For peanuts | Peanut butter
